<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,454.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,454.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,454 today from 1,445 on March 11, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1488    13.513	  1490    13.531</p>
<p>   1a   1461 11063.000	  1454 11013.000</p>
